  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Best fish farmer competition 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This PSD Toolkit project aims to engage young people who have studied aquaculture but are missing the skills and support to become a successful fish farming entrepreneur in Kenya either as a fish farmer or in the value chain on feed supply, fish distribution, cold chain or public sector. By organising the third edition of the Best Fish Farmer Competition and Award Event, a group of young aspiring fish farmers will be challenged. This project will be beneficial for the development of the aquaculture sector to train aspiring fish farmers, link them to the Aquaculture Academy and other fish farmers in order to exchange knowledge and experiences. To involve the bordering counties around the Lake Victoria Basin may support the sector as well.</narrative>
  </description>
